# Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) Summary Report

## Project
Customer Purchase Prediction

## Objective
Analyze customer data and prepare it for machine learning model development.

## Data Preprocessing
- Checked missing values
- Removed duplicate records
- Encoded categorical variables
- Applied feature scaling using StandardScaler

## Analysis
- Performed descriptive statistics
- Analyzed feature correlations
- Created Histogram, Scatter Plot, and Bar Chart

## Machine Learning
- Trained Logistic Regression, KNN, and Decision Tree models
- Compared Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and F1-Score
- Evaluated models using a Confusion Matrix
- Saved the best-performing model using Joblib

## Conclusion
The dataset was successfully preprocessed and analyzed. Multiple machine learning models were evaluated, and the best model was selected to predict customer purchase behavior.

